      "text": "Two datasets are published: Magicoder-OSS-Instruct-75K (generated with gpt-3.5-turbo-1106, used for both model series) and Magicoder-Evol-Instruct-110K (decontaminated redistribution of evol-codealpaca-v1, used for the -S models)."
